# Research outputs (generated, not hand-authored - regenerate via make targets).
# Exception: a small set of figures embedded in README.md are tracked as
# checked-in snapshots so the README renders standalone from a fresh clone
# without requiring `make benchmark && make train && make research` first -
# see the explicit !allowlist below. They are still fully regenerable and
# get overwritten by `make research`; only the ones the README links to are
# tracked, everything else in these directories remains generated-only.
research/figures/*.png
research/figures/*.pdf
research/tables/*.csv
research/tables/*.md
research/tables/*.json
!research/figures/.gitkeep
!research/tables/.gitkeep
!research/figures/keygen_classical_vs_pqc.png
!research/figures/risk_model_comparison.png
!research/tables/benchmark_comparison.md

